<title>UK: SuedwestLB unit sets 1.5 bln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB unit sets 1.5 bln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+5-7 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING FFT/STUT/LON PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT JAN 2002 GOOFA</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
